    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ruac Kuɔth Nhial ben kä Yeɣu gat Ɣä-na-ni kɛ kui̱ Bɛ̈ca wëë i̱, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ɣän cä ji̱ kap nhial ni rɛy tupä kä cä ji̱ jak kä bo̱o̱th nɛɛnikä ni ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, kä ci guɔ̱ɔ̱r ni duɔ̱ɔ̱p Ya-rɔ-baam, kä ci nɛɛkä jak kä dui̱r, kä ci ɣä jak kä gak kɛ dueerkiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛnɛ, ɣän bä Bɛ̈ca däk kɛnɛ dhɔrɛ, kä bä dhɔru jak kä ce̱tkɛ dhɔr Ya-rɔ-baam gat Nɛ-bat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä bi jio̱o̱k duŋ Bɛ̈ca mɔ bi li̱w rɛy wec ɔ cam. Kä bi diit nhial min bi li̱w rɛy dɔaar cam.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua duɔth lätni Bɛ̈ca diaal gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk kuɛ̈ɛ̈ni kua̱ri I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ li̱w, kä cua jɛ kony kä Ti̱r-dha. Kä cu gatdɛ ni Elaa ruëc kɛ gua̱a̱thdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ruac Kuɔth lɛni ben kä Yeɣu gat Ɣä-na-ni kɛ kui̱ Bɛ̈ca kɛnɛ dhɔrɛ, kɛ kui̱ lätnikɛ tin jiäk waaŋ Kuɔth Nhial kä cɛ jɛ jak kä gak, kɛ ɣöö ce̱t lätkɛ kɛ lät dhɔaar Ya-rɔ-baam, kɛnɛ ɣöö cɛ dhɔr Ya-rɔ-baam däk.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl ni Elaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ ruɔ̱n jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ bäkɛl ruëc Atha kuäär Juda, cu Elaa gat Bɛ̈ca a kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl kä Ti̱r-dha, kä cuɛ ruëc kɛ run rɛw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö cu raan kɔaarɛ ni Dhim-ri bo̱o̱th tha̱a̱ŋ thurbiɛɛlikɛ jɛ ca̱p mi jiääk, mëë tëë kä Ti̱r-dha. Yɔŋ ni jɛn kɛ kɔaŋ dhɔr Ar-dha, ti̱i̱t duëël kuäärä kä Ti̱r-dha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Dhim-ri jɛ ben näk kɛ run ruëc Atha kuäär Juda ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ bärɔw. Kä cu Dhim-ri ruëc kɛ gua̱a̱thdɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min cɛ ɛ kuäär ka̱n, cuɛ ji̱ dhɔaar Bɛ̈ca näk kɛn diaal. Cuɛ thil ram kɛl kä ji̱ maarädɛ mi cuɛ päl a tëk amäni mäthnikɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu Dhim-ri dhɔr Bɛ̈ca däk kɛɛliw, cua ni ruac Kuɔth Nhial ëë cɛ lat kɛ kui̱ Bɛ̈ca kɛ thok go̱kä ni Yeɣu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ dueeri Bɛ̈ca diaal kɛnɛ dueer Elaa gatdɛ tëë ci kɛn kɛ dui̱r, kɛnɛ tëë jakɛ I-thɛ-rɛl kä dui̱r, kä jakɛ Kuoth Nhial kä gak kɛ kuth I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua duɔth lätni Elaa gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk kuɛ̈ɛ̈ni kua̱ri I-thɛ-rɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl ni Dhim-ri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ run ruëc Atha kuäär Juda ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ bärɔw, cu Dhim-ri ruëc kɛ ni̱n bärɔw kä Ti̱r-dha. Kä täämɛ ci rɛm pua̱t lotdä Gi-bɛ-thon, wec ji̱ Pi-li-thɛt, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu rɛm in ci pua̱t ɛ liŋ i̱ ci Dhim-ri mi jiäk ca̱p kuäär kä cɛ näk, cukɛ Ɔmri bo̱o̱th rɛ̈m jak kä kuäär kä I-thɛ-rɛl ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ rɛy wec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cu Ɔmri kɛnɛ ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl diaal jiɛn kä Gi-bɛ-thon wa Ti̱r-dha go̱l. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë ci Dhim-ri jɛ nɛn i̱ ca wec ku thuŋ ka̱n, cuɛ wä rɛy duëël kuäärä kä cuɛ rɔ waŋ rɛc, kä cuɛ li̱w, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kui̱ dueerikɛ tin cɛ la̱t, kɛ kui̱ lätni kä ti jiäk waaŋ Kuɔth Nhial, kä cɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r ni dup Ya-rɔ-baam, kɛnɛ dueerkɛ tin ci I-thɛ-rɛl jak kä dui̱r. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua duɔth lätnikɛ gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk kuɛ̈ɛ̈ni kua̱ri I-thɛ-rɛl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl ni Ɔmri",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl rɔ̱ da̱a̱k kä rɛɛw. Cu tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn wä kɔɔr Tib-ni gat Gi-nɛ̈th, cua jɛ jak kä kuäär kä cu tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn wä kɔɔr Ɔmri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu nɛy tin te kɔɔr Ɔmri nɛy tin te kɔɔr Tib-ni gat Gi-nɛ̈th tiam. Kä cu Tib-ni li̱w, kä cu Ɔmri a kuäär. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ run ruëc Atha kuäär Juda ti jiɛn diɔ̱k wi̱cdɛ kɛl cu Ɔmri a kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl, cuɛ ruëc kɛ run wäl rɛw. Cuɛ ruëc kä Ti̱r-dha kɛ run bäkɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ päm Tha-mɛ-ria kɔk kä Cɛ-mɛr kɛ yio̱w ti bathdɔɔri bäkɛl. Kä cuɛ täth ɛn wec pa̱a̱m, kä cuɛ jɛ cɔli Tha-mɛ-ria, kɛ ciöt Cɛ-mɛr in la gua̱n pa̱a̱m.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
