          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɔmri la̱t ni jiäk waaŋ Kuɔth Nhial, cɛ la̱t ni ti ce̱tkɛ tëë ca la̱t ɛ nɛy tëë te nhiamdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ guɔ̱ɔ̱r ni duɔ̱p Ya-rɔ-baam gat Nɛ-bat, kɛnɛ dueer tin cɛ I-thɛ-rɛl jak kä dui̱r, kä cɛ Kuoth Nhial Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl jak kä gak kɛ kui̱ kuthnikiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua duɔth lätnikɛ gɔ̱a̱r rɛy buɔk kuɛ̈ɛ̈ni kua̱ri I-thɛ-rɛl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɔmri li̱w, kä cua jɛ kony kä Tha-mɛ-ria. Kä cu gatdɛ ni Ɛ̈-ɣab kuäärɛ guäl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl ni Ɛ̈-ɣab",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä kɛ run rui̱cä Atha kuäär Juda ti jiɛn diɔ̱k wi̱cdɛ bädäk, cu Ɛ̈-ɣab gat Ɔmri a kuäär Kä I-thɛ-rɛl, kä cuɛ I-thɛ-rɛl ruac kä Tha-mɛ-ria kɛ run ti jiɛn da̱ŋ rɛw wi̱cdɛ rɛw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Ɛ̈-ɣab gat Ɔmri dueer ti ŋuan nikɛn la̱t waaŋ Kuɔth Nhial Kä nɛy diaal tëë te nhiamdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ ce̱tkɛ mi puɔl puɔl kä jɛ ɛn guur duɔ̱p Ya-rɔ-baam gat Nɛ-bat, kä cuɛ I-dhɛ-bɛl nya Ɛth-baal kuäär ji̱ Dhi-don kuɛn, kä cuɛ wä pal ni kuoth Baal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kuoth Baal lät kä yi̱k rɛy luak kuɔth Baal in cɛ ta̱th jɛ kä Tha-mɛ-ria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kuoth Ä-ce-ra täth. Kä cuɛ mi cu Kuoth Nhial Kuoth I-thɛ-rɛl jak kä gak la̱t, cuɛ leny ni kua̱r I-thɛ-rɛl diaal tëë te nhiamdɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ run ruëc Ɛ̈-ɣab, cu Ɣi-el raan Beth-ɛl rɛk Jɛ-ri-ko nyɔk kɛ ta̱th. Mëë tääthɛ pänydɛ cu gatdɛ min kɛ̱̈ɛ̱̈ ni Ä-bi-ram li̱w, kä mëë lätdɛ thi̱i̱kdɛ cu gatdɛ min tɔt ni Thɛ-gub li̱w, ce̱tnikɛ ruac Kuɔth Nhial ëë cɛ lat kɛ thok Jɔ-cua gat Nun.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
